                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Amazing game. It's a puzzle platformer, with just 2 interactions, lots of cool puzzles, lots of completionist content if you are into that. It's not really a metroidvania since everything is accessible, but you're probably not going to figure out how to get to certain parts until later. The game starts of easy, but puzzles start becoming more advanced later, if you get stuck on some puzzle you can go to another area.",
